{"title":"악마의 아이","artist":"히구치 아이","sourceId":"reference:wXCYCkAKxsxQwclLIHPp","sourceHash":"0847bf12e04e85aa7fee53a27393f835231b213c907347ed8d206088a2225b20","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":22312250,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.07,"end":3.847,"text":"鉄の弾が 正義の証明","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.847,"end":6.56,"text":"貫けば 英雄に近づいた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":6.56,"end":9.16,"text":"その目を閉じて 触れてみれば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":9.16,"end":14.41,"text":"同じ形 同じ体温の悪魔","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":14.41,"end":16.8,"text":"僕はダメで あいつはいいの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":16.8,"end":19.94,"text":"そこに壁があっただけなのに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":19.94,"end":22.62,"text":"生まれてしまった 運命嘆くな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":22.62,"end":26.37,"text":"僕らはみんな 自由なんだから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":26.37,"end":31.82,"text":"鳥のように 羽があれば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":31.82,"end":37.04,"text":"どこへだって行けるけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":37.04,"end":41.15,"text":"帰る場所が なければ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":41.15,"end":46.43,"text":"きっとどこへも行けない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":46.43,"end":51.99,"text":"ただただ生きるのは嫌だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":51.99,"end":62.69,"text":"世界は残酷だ それでも君を愛すよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":62.69,"end":72.69,"text":"なにを犠牲にしても それでも君を守るよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":72.69,"end":77.76,"text":"間違いだとしても 疑ったりしない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":77.76,"end":83.9,"text":"正しさとは 自分のこと 強く信じることだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":93.16,"end":95.84,"text":"鉄の雨が 降り散る情景","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":95.84,"end":98.64,"text":"テレビの中 映画に見えたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":98.64,"end":101.34,"text":"戦争なんて 愚かな凶暴","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":101.34,"end":103.92,"text":"関係ない 知らない国の話","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":103.92,"end":106.67,"text":"それならなんで あいつ憎んで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":106.67,"end":109.28,"text":"黒い気持ち 隠しきれない理由","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":109.28,"end":111.81,"text":"説明だって できやしないんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":111.81,"end":117.68,"text":"僕らはなんて 矛盾ばっかなんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":137.04,"end":142.41,"text":"この言葉も 訳されれば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":142.41,"end":147.67000000000002,"text":"本当の意味は伝わらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":147.67000000000002,"end":153.27,"text":"信じるのは その目を開いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":153.27,"end":157.17000000000002,"text":"触れた世界だけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":157.17000000000002,"end":163.01,"text":"ただただ生きるのは嫌だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":165.77,"end":176.32999999999998,"text":"世界は残酷だ それでも君を愛すよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":176.32999999999998,"end":186.3,"text":"なにを犠牲にしても それでも君を守るよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":186.3,"end":191.44,"text":"選んだ人の影 捨てたものの屍","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":191.44,"end":196.81,"text":"気づいたんだ 自分の中 育つのは悪魔の子","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":196.81,"end":201.28,"text":"正義の裏 犠牲の中 心には悪魔の子","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}